{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：10:25 2026-09-24 HKT</p>\n\n<p>元朗壆圍南路於周日（20日）發生懷疑狗隻咬死人事件，27歲姓朱夜歸女倒斃行人路上，身體多處有被動物撕咬及抓傷的痕迹。連日多警方聯同漁護署採取行動，多次到案發現場附近搜捕無人看管或流浪狗隻。今日（24日）早上，警方與漁護署再度進行聯合行動，在壆圍南路一帶捉狗。</p>\n<img alt=\"警方聯同漁護署採取聯合行動，在壆圍南路一帶捉狗。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6cb950c3adc1d76a7bc095edf18b32c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_38_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f466017bb71db96ab809b2970faffd5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a75b3071f8e3bb649246f0fb7c19f9aa/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_37_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"行動共派出約80人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6eaf642377dfbb95988c2b342ba41d90/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce57085766985dce85df87d7846d39a6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_38_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f741d204d3f8d460780c9ab6ec79b18/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方聯同漁護署採取聯合行動，在壆圍南路一帶捉狗。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7cf9cab334ab1150d264299e0278b73/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_56_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9303d59ea0f3ce734f0ebe3827fd640a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_51_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b0b961ce2825bb7d5404680bc7f7b73/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_51_12.jpeg\"/>\n<p>今日早上9時許，警方與漁護署共派出約80人，當中包括警方新界北快速應變部隊、衝鋒隊、元朗刑事部及警犬組等人員，而漁護署亦有港九新界捉狗隊參與；他們首先在元朗南生圍集合，然後出發到壆圍南路、壆圍西路、攸壆路及錦壆路一帶搜索無人看管的狗隻。其間人員重點搜捕有可能具兇暴攻擊性的流浪狗，以及未植入晶片的犬隻，最終會將捕捉的狗隻交由漁護署跟進。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51f1edbf9001b297379e028f62e17d5b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_51_11_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有警員手持盾牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa5c9acf4e2c4004b8e6239cb6d66495/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_51_11.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/880f74253c85f890146646a4e3c2ab6b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08f35ea38bac88a451e7e66a7439afb2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aadd8f5436bd4fd195cd08e85f495db1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9214267579c50b69433dce04cdaab57e/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c51b930680aca3f00d45632b2da0e59d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_37_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/759a25bdfaead28197b6fad001197932/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_37.jpeg\"/>\n<p>連日來警方與漁護署已多次展開聯合行動，繼較早前行動中所捕獲的5隻流浪狗外，至昨日的行動再捕獲3隻流浪狗，累計已有8隻狗被捕獲，並交由漁農自然護理署檢查。據悉其中一隻被捕獲有晶片的唐狗，其登記主人為動物保護組織「毛守救援」的創辦人Kent，他被漁護署以「沒有妥善管控狗隻」、「過期狗牌」兩罪控告。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59f032923cad4e6d667387aee8db1e4b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ace20aafc6c87c4c4fb7d987ab3f1ce9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_36.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方和漁護署共派出約80人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d10c0e2ddacefb2e6112db5bdb9ed6b1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_35_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24b45b4fc8a3b01a80496daf101568c7/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_34_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警方聯同漁護署採取聯合行動，在壆圍南路一帶捉狗。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44db93b616e2c8bc7fd9be9a24a56d0b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7697dd97325cea80a4a12a1ee6edba51/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/60dd704fce199935ece95fbc7f48bb4b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_32_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9b0aae2ea851a44d121c093588ebca9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_32.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92891b567a1e6dd1d39d620683c81363/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5258088a726a43a989c45bb1e6de6340/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-24_at_09_40_29.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T03:19:57.794443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":472,"images":27,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}